<title>JAPAN: Mitsubishi Chemical hits 1997 high.</title>
<headline>Mitsubishi Chemical hits 1997 high.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Mitsubishi Chemical Corp hit a new high for this calendar year on Monday morning in active trading, brokers said.</p>
<p>Mitsubishi Chemical climbed briefly to 428 yen, its highest price this calendar year.</p>
<p>At 0135 GMT, the share wa 11 yen higher at 421. Traded volume was 2.789 million shares, the third heaviest on the first section of the Tokyo Stock Exchange.  </p>
<p>Investors are attracted to sectors, such as chemicals, whose earnings are expected to be stable, partly helped by the yen's recent weakness against the dollar, the brokers said.</p>
